/bhhslaboral.com.ar/category/noticias/" class=3D"newsx-cat-1" rel=3D"catego=
ry tag">Noticias</a></li></ul></div><h1>An=C3=A1lisis del Anexo VII Inciso =
3. Medios de Escape. Protecci=C3=B3n Contra Incendios. Decreto 351/79 Regla=
mento de Higiene y Seguridad en el Trabajo</h1><div class=3D"newsx-post-met=
a newsx-flex"><div class=3D"newsx-post-meta-inn-wrap newsx-flex"><div class=
=3D"newsx-post-meta-inner newsx-flex"><div class=3D"newsx-post-meta-inn-gro=
up newsx-flex"><div class=3D"newsx-post-author">Por <a href=3D"https://bhhs=
